load @/code/vibe/dock
  find dock

note <The mesh, the whole of space, the fifth base element. One growing hyperbolic honeycomb of identical docks joined face to face, whose cells are 24-cells. It is discrete, hyperbolic so that room opens up faster than flat space, and it grows at its open edge. Its flat boundary is the three-dimensional space we live in.>

form mesh
  link docks, like list, like dock
